# Packages publish to GitHub Packages.
# Auth: classic PAT with `write:packages` (publish) or `read:packages`
# (install). In CI, setup-node supplies NODE_AUTH_TOKEN. Locally run
# `npm login --scope=@ponado-org --auth-type=legacy --registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com`.
# Never commit a token here.
@ponado-org:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
